certforge (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * ACME certificate issuance and renewal via DNS-01 challenges (RFC 8555)
  * RFC 2136 dynamic DNS updates with TSIG authentication
  * DANE TLSA record publication (RFC 6698/7671/7672)
  * Key rotation with DANE pre-publication protocol
  * ECDSA P-256 and P-384 key generation
  * systemd credential integration (systemd-creds encrypt/decrypt)
  * systemd unit reload/restart hooks via D-Bus
  * TOML configuration with per-zone DNS overrides
  * Systemd service and timer units included

 -- Roman Kivalin <roman@shl.dev>  Sat, 12 Apr 2026 18:00:00 +0000
